# Stations PDF (current)

Single button: **Export Stations PDF** on Portfolio → Stations (`exportPortfolioStationsPdf` in `build-unified-v2.cjs`).

## Screen (Stations tab)

**Overview** = compare bar chart (items/staff-hr by station × location) + station chips + one hour×day×location table for the selected station.

## PDF structure

1. **Chart page** — RDG logo + full-page items/staff-hr bar chart only (no week matrix, no multi-station portfolio pages).
2. **Per station** — white **title divider** (dark RDG logo top-right, navy pill with station name, navy footer).
3. **Day × location table** (one station per page, large type):
   - **Rows (Y)** = days Mon…Sun + Week
   - **Columns (X)** = locations (Claudie / Casa Neos / AVA CG / AVA WP / MILA)
   - Each location: **Ful · Items/staff-hr · Items/person**

Do **not** emit former “Portfolio - Stations 1-3 / 7-8” multi-family pages.

## Logo assets

- Source: official RDG mark (waves + mountains, RDG, riviera dining group).
- Processed: `assets/rdg-logo-light.png` (white on transparent) and `assets/rdg-logo-dark.png` (navy on transparent).
- Never embed the raw dark-on-black JPEG alone — it reads as a blank black box.
- Rebuild embeds base64 via `RDG_LOGO_LIGHT_DATA_URL` / `RDG_LOGO_DARK_DATA_URL`.

## History

- Former multi-station portfolio pages and hour×day PDF pages were removed from the PDF; hour×day stays on the screen Overview only.
